<section class="tcc">
    <div class="inner">

        <div class="img-col">
            <img src="/img/img21.webp" alt="Terapia Cognitiva Conductual" />
        </div>

        <div class="text-col">
            <span class="badge">Mi estilo terapéutico</span>
            <h2>Terapia Cognitiva<br/><em>Conductual</em></h2>
            <div class="accent-line"></div>
            <p>
                Se orienta a la búsqueda de patrones de conducta y pensamientos
                que limitan la vida o generan gran malestar.
            </p>
            <p>
                Desde un trabajo activo y una escucha colaborativa identificaremos
                la fuente de malestar y trabajaremos juntos hacia el cambio.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .tcc {
        padding: 70px 0 60px;
    }

    .inner {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 70px;
    }

    /* ── IMAGE ── */
    .img-col {
        flex: 0 0 44%;
        animation: slideLeft linear both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: entry 0% cover 40%;
    }

    @keyframes slideLeft {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-50px); }
        to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
    }

    .img-col img {
        width: 100%;
        display: block;
        border-radius: 80px 8px 80px 8px;
        box-shadow:
            0 24px 60px rgba(28,88,76,0.18),
            0 0 0 8px rgba(139,253,44,0.1);
    }

    /* ── TEXT ── */
    .text-col {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 18px;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(28,88,76,0.1);
        color: #1c584c;
        padding: 5px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        width: fit-content;
    }

    .text-col h2 {
        font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 42px);
        font-weight: 200;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .text-col h2 em {
        font-style: normal;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #1c584c;
    }

    .accent-line {
        width: 52px;
        height: 4px;
        background: #8bfd2c;
        border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .text-col p {
        font-size: clamp(15px, 1.5vw, 17px);
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #555;
    }

    /* ── MOBILE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .tcc { padding: 48px 0 40px; }

        .inner {
            width: 92%;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .img-col {
            flex: unset;
            width: 100%;
            animation: none;
        }

        .img-col img {
            border-radius: 20px;
            height: 280px;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center 20%;
        }
    }
</style>
